# requirements-list.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Summary list only, no elaboration
- Updated in real time
- No references to or pointers to other files/entries
- No decision information
- Clean and concise

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Requirements list

### H2 (required)
- Functional requirements table: ID / requirement

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Non-functional requirements table: ID / requirement
- [optional] Scope exclusion table: ID / exclusion
